{"uid":"9cc4a8087b32e7fe","name":"test_does_not_reap_when_heartbeat_refreshes_mid_sweep","fullName":"tests.test_orchestrator_janitor#test_does_not_reap_when_heartbeat_refreshes_mid_sweep","historyId":"9f72ec602a4dff6fca4704dfbe740b0a","time":{"start":1782862743093,"stop":1782862743117,"duration":24},"description":"TOCTOU regression: a heartbeat that lands between the janitor's\n    SELECT and the per-row UPDATE must leave the job untouched\n    (no ``failed`` status, no audit row, no metric).\n\n    The race window:\n\n    1. Janitor SELECTs jobs with stale heartbeats — gets RFN-RACE.\n    2. *In a different session* the worker writes a fresh\n       ``last_heartbeat_at``.\n    3. Janitor attempts to UPDATE the row to ``failed``.\n\n    Pre-fix, step 3 succeeded unconditionally (the in-session ORM\n    mutation didn't re-check the heartbeat predicate). Post-fix, the\n    atomic ``UPDATE ... WHERE last_heartbeat_at < :cutoff`` matches\n    zero rows and the janitor cleanly skips it.\n\n    We simulate the race by:\n    a) Building a janitor whose ``_find_stale`` loads the candidate.\n    b) Refreshing the heartbeat directly via SQL (separate session)\n       between ``_find_stale`` and ``_reap``.\n    ","descriptionHtml":"<p>TOCTOU regression: a heartbeat that lands between the janitor's<br />\nSELECT and the per-row UPDATE must leave the job untouched<br />\n(no <code>failed</code> status, no audit row, no metric).</p>\n<pre><code>The race window:\n\n1. Janitor SELECTs jobs with stale heartbeats — gets RFN-RACE.\n2. *In a different session* the worker writes a fresh\n   ``last_heartbeat_at``.\n3. Janitor attempts to UPDATE the row to ``failed``.\n\nPre-fix, step 3 succeeded unconditionally (the in-session ORM\nmutation didn't re-check the heartbeat predicate). Post-fix, the\natomic ``UPDATE ... WHERE last_heartbeat_at &lt; :cutoff`` matches\nzero rows and the janitor cleanly skips it.\n\nWe simulate the race by:\na) Building a janitor whose ``_find_stale`` loads the candidate.\nb) Refreshing the heartbeat directly via SQL (separate session)\n   between ``_find_stale`` and ``_reap``.\n</code></pre>\n","status":"passed","flaky":false,"newFailed":false,"newBroken":false,"newPassed":false,"retriesCount":0,"retriesStatusChange":false,"beforeStages":[{"name":"event_loop_policy","time":{"start":1782862119939,"stop":1782862119939,"duration":0},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"tmp_path_factory","time":{"start":1782862120351,"stop":1782862120351,"duration":0},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"_clear_prompt_info_cache","time":{"start":1782862742911,"stop":1782862742911,"duration":0},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"monkeypatch","time":{"start":1782862742911,"stop":1782862742911,"duration":0},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"tmp_path","time":{"start":1782862742911,"stop":1782862742913,"duration":2},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"_reset_tracer_singleton","time":{"start":1782862742911,"stop":1782862742911,"duration":0},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"_reset_pricing_source","time":{"start":1782862742911,"stop":1782862742911,"duration":0},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":